<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is a macro I created for my Arch Bishop to auto-skills almost all the passive for parties while training.
You can follow the parties, without having to click any skills. It is especially useful if you have your own supporting priest, so you do not need to re-click on the main character to follow again after casting buff.

Feel free to change the skills, but I have timed it properly, so my skills can stay through all time. Especially for those with short duration, like Gloria, it was in key S, and will be casted 3 times before repeat on Suffagium which is in key Q. 
Then the whole loop shall repeat again as Magnificat going to end too. 

Skills level based on below:

Q - Suffagium [Level 3]
W - Impositio Manus [Level 3]
E - Magnificat [Level 5]
R - Cantocandidus [Level 2]
T - Clementia [Level 2]
Y - Praefatio [Level 1]
S - Gloria [Level 3]

This is my first very happy experiment that works in recording macro. Please let me know if you want any other macro, I will be happy to try out making it.

Happy gaming happy leveling. :)</Description>
    <Comment>Please leave a comment for me to improve and learn more about these.

https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
